    <bpmn:process id="W_W1875" name="W1875. Lease Accounting Policy Review &amp; IFRS Update Assessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual policy review; IFRS amendment or new interpretation
Frequency: Annual policy review; ad-hoc for IFRS updates
Volume: 1 comprehensive review per year; ad-hoc assessments for regulatory changes
Owner: Controller
Participants: Controller, CFO, External Auditor, Lease Accounting Specialist
Source: workflow W1875 — Lease Accounting Policy Review &amp; IFRS Update Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1875_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1875_Lane1" name="Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1875_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1875_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1875_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1875_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1875_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1875_Start3" name="Annual policy review; IFRS amendment or new interpretation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1875_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1875_Task4" name="Annual: Controller reviews lease accounting policy: (a) discount rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Annual: Controller reviews lease accounting policy: (a) discount rate methodology: is the incremental borrowing rate (IBR) calculation methodology still appropriate? Update for changes in BuildRight&#x27;s credit rating, borrowing costs, or market conditions, (b) lease term assessment policy: criteria for assessing &quot;reasonably certain&quot; exercise of extension/termination options — update for any changes in store strategy, (c) impairment assessment: are any ROU assets impaired? (stores with significant sales decline where lease liability exceeds recoverable amount from store operations), (d) low-value and short-term lease thresholds: are thresholds still appropriate given inflation?, (e) sublease accounting policy: ensure classification (operating vs. finance) is correct for any active subleases per W1860
Responsible (R): Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1–2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1875_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1875_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1875_Task5" name="Ad-hoc: Controller assesses impact of IFRS amendments on lease accounting: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ad-hoc: Controller assesses impact of IFRS amendments on lease accounting: (a) monitor IFRS amendments and interpretations from IASB, (b) assess applicability to BuildRight&#x27;s lease portfolio, (c) quantify financial statement impact of any required changes, (d) implement changes with External Auditor concurrence, (e) update accounting policies and train Lease Accounting Specialist
Responsible (R): Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1–2 days per assessment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1875_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1875_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1875_Task6" name="Annual: Controller documents lease accounting policies in financial statement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Annual: Controller documents lease accounting policies in financial statement notes: (a) significant judgments and estimates (discount rate, lease term), (b) accounting policy for leases per PFRS 16, (c) impact of any new IFRS amendments adopted during the year
Responsible (R): Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per W9B (year-end close)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1875_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1875_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1875_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1875_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-369 (ensure controlled execution — Property Tax, LGU Compliance &amp; Lease Accounting (PA-42.3).) | - operational: Controller review and approval gate
Owner: Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
